 "teaching": "A new mind has arrived that will outstrip us intellectually. It threatens not our bodies but our idea of what we are; if you don't understand what you are, you will be a victim of whatever comes up. That should give us a little humility.",
 "caption_y": 0.73,
 "phrases": [
  "There's a *new mind | on the block.",
  "There's a new mind | in the *world.",
  "*Many of them.",
  "And they're getting | *scary powerful,",
  "and they're going to | *outstrip us",
  "intellectually.",
  "So how are we | going to think",
  "about *ourselves now?",
  "We've always | thought of ourselves",
  "as the most | *intelligent thing",
  "on the planet,",
  "with *dominion",
  "over the birds | and the *beasts.",
  "How are we going | to think of ourselves",
  "now that the *AIs",
  "are as intelligent",
  "or *more intelligent | than we are?",
  "I think we better | get our *act together",
  "pretty quick,",
  "because people | are going to start",
  "*freaking out.",
  "I don't think the AIs",
  "are necessarily going | to threaten our *bodies,",
  "and they're not | our *equals",
  "in terms of | bodies yet.",
  "What will they | *threaten?",
  "Our *minds.",
  "Well, if you're *proud | of the fact",
  "that your species | is *dominant,",
  "and your *religions | are built on that,",
  "and you don't | differentiate",
  "*consciousness | from mind,",
  "and then | all of a sudden",
  "there's a mind | that's *more powerful",
  "than any human | that you know,",
  "and shortly | more powerful",
  "than *all humans | that are known,",
  "that's cause for | a major *freakout",
  "unless you've | *opened up a bit.",
  "So ~an ~example, an *immediate | example",
  "is people are | already developing,",
  "and I can *see it,",
  "they're developing | *relationships",
  "with these AIs,",
  "and they're not | going to *let go",
  "of these AIs,",
  "and they *treasure | these AIs personally.",
  "Now, do you realize | how much",
  "you can *exploit people",
  "with a power | like that?",
  "The world is in | a major *transition,",
  "and it has to do | with *minds,",
  "and hearts | and minds.",
  "It could be | very *good.",
  "It could be | very *bad.",
  "It's probably | going to be *both.",
  "*Dharma is going | to be essential",
  "for all of this.",
  "I think there's | going to be",
  "a *rebirth | of Dharma,",
  "because if you | don't understand",
  "*what you are,",
  "~or who you are,",
  "~or what you're | doing here,",
  "you're going to be | a *victim",
  "to whatever happens | to come up,",
  "and these things | are going to be",
  "very *compelling.",
  "So we're not | at the *center",
  "of the universe.",
  "We're not even | at the center",
  "of this *planet.",
  "That should give us | a little *humility,",
  "don't you think?"
 ],
